  "2016 P1 Q1": {"skill":"A parallel line through a point.","method":"2 marks","moves":["What do parallel lines have in common?","Rearrange \\(y + 4x = 7\\) to read its gradient. Parallel lines have the same gradient.","Use \\(y - b = m(x - a)\\) through \\((-2, 3)\\), and simplify."],"marks":[0,1,1],"shows":[null,null,null],"watch":{"at":1,"text":"The gradient of \\(y + 4x = 7\\) is \\(-4\\): rearrange it before you read it off."}},
