  "2016 P1 Q12": {"skill":"A composite function, then completing the square.","method":"(a) 2 marks, (b) 3 marks","moves":["In \\(f(g(x))\\), which function acts on \\(x\\) first?","(a) \\(f(g(x))\\) means put \\(3 - x\\) into \\(f\\) wherever there is an \\(x\\). Expand and simplify.","(b) Take out \\(2\\) as a common factor of the \\(x\\) terms, and complete the square inside.","(b) Multiply the constant back out by \\(2\\) and collect it with \\(11\\)."],"marks":[0,2,2,1],"shows":[null,"\\(2(3 - x)^2 - 4(3 - x) + 5\\)","\\(2[x^2 - 4x \\ldots\\)",null],"watch":{"at":2,"text":"Show a line of working between \\(f(3 - x)\\) and the simplified answer."}},
